SUMMARY:Sense & Sensibility: Coffee + Movie Night at Biltmore Park
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nJoin us for an evening at Biltmo
 re Park to see Sense & Sensibility at Regal!\n\nWe’ll meet beforehand at
  the café inside Barnes & Noble in Biltmore Park. Grab a coffee or someth
 ing to eat\, and we’ll have some time to chat and get to know each other
  before heading over to the theater together.\n\nSince the event is still 
 about a month away\, Regal hasn’t posted showtimes yet. Once showtimes b
 ecome available\, I’ll update everyone with the movie time and let you k
 now when it’s time to purchase tickets so we can coordinate our seats.\n
 \n☕ Meet: Barnes & Noble Café at Biltmore Park\n🎬 Movie: Sense & Sen
 sibility at Regal Biltmore Grande\n\nCome on your own or bring a friend. I
 t should be a fun\, relaxed evening and a great chance to meet some new pe
 ople!
